WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:07.959
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, this week on
Gotham was the beginning of Arkham Asylum’s

00:00:07.959 --> 00:00:11.270
season long story and it’s going to serve
as the battleground for a war between the

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.000
powers that be.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.050
I know everyone that’s played the Arkham
games will have a lot more fun with this,

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:24.500
but Arkham in general is probably the second
coolest place to visit in Gotham next to The

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Batcave.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.460
Which as we learned in Dark Knight, is technically
not located inside Gotham County.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.610
Stupid Know-It All Two Face.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:36.140
I’ve also got some big big comic book Avengers
and Batman vs Superman related news that I’ll

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.079
mention at the end of the video.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:40.170
But careful for spoilers if you haven’t
seen the episode yet.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:43.539
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, Here are my
Top 5 Moments…

00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.980
Number 5 - The Penguin Stops By

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.839
This explained a lot of the questions I had
after the last episode.

00:00:48.839 --> 00:00:51.710
With the whole Gordon Barbara Murder Mystery
plot.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.089
Penguin used a fake name, so they’re just
going to keep him a secret until it blows

00:00:55.089 --> 00:00:56.090
up in their face.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.260
Which it will.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:02.730
There is no dirty secret in the Batman Verse
that won’t eventually blow up in your face.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:06.051
Based on the way the action played out, their
partnership right now seems like it’s more

00:01:06.051 --> 00:01:10.810
about the Penguin using Gordon to get rid
of his trash rather than Gordon taking advantage

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:11.810
of someone on the inside.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:14.730
In the comics, Gordon has worked with the
more sociable villains like The Penguin and

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:15.730
The Riddler.

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.960
A lot of Batman villains lack the desire or
the intelligence for actual detective work.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.080
I was surprised that Gordon split with Barbara
over the secret.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.210
Their marriage in the comics was always on
the brink of divorce because of things like

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:24.430
this, we just get to see more of it because
this is a 22 episode season instead of a 2

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:25.430
hour movie.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.270
That’s right, gotham just got picked up
for a full season.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.230
Originally I think it was only 14 episodes,
now the total is 22.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:30.230
Which makes the chances of a season 2 much
much better.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.310
Number 4 - Fish Mooney Explains the Sexual
Politics of Gotham

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:36.840
I kept trying to find comic book easter eggs
in the singer characters she was auditioning.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:43.730
But all I could find was a villain on Batman
Beyond named Spellbound.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:47.250
Making them fight to the death did remind
me of Heath Ledger in Dark Knight.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.140
Two candidates, but only one opening.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:54.690
I don’t know why they needed to linger on
the seduction moment so long.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:02:06.350
I guess they were just trying to make it extra
sexy but I thought it was kind of awkward.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:11.049
It seems like Mooney will use the woman against
Falcone.

00:02:11.049 --> 00:02:16.359
Because she got rid of his last girlfriend.

00:02:16.359 --> 00:02:20.209
Number 3 - No Country for Old Batman Villains

00:02:20.209 --> 00:02:23.220
It think we can assume the Penguin is the
one who hired Gladwell.

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:26.069
We already know he was the one to trash the
restaurant.

00:02:26.069 --> 00:02:28.659
That was what the bit with the Cannoli was
at the end.

00:02:28.659 --> 00:02:31.750
He was getting rid of the hitmen he hired
to kill everyone.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:35.959
Gladwell wasn’t someone from the comics,
even though he did take one of the victims

00:02:35.959 --> 00:02:37.269
to Arkham.

00:02:37.269 --> 00:02:41.670
Now that they’ve got an extra 8 episodes
this season they’ll probably re-write everything

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:48.709
they haven’t shot to extend that storyline
to the finale.

00:02:48.709 --> 00:02:53.090
Meaning we’ll see the characters playing
around Arkham More and More.

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.709
The evidence that the Penguin killed the Waynes
or was directly responsible for it is stacking

00:02:55.709 --> 00:02:56.709
up.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:03:00.810
Based on what Bruce said, their murder had
something to do with the Arkham City development.

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:05.720
And who have we seen staring at a plotted
map of the city with Arkham at the center.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:10.459
It’s like the penguin created the war for
Arkham as a way to clear a path for himself.

00:03:10.459 --> 00:03:19.279
So you have all the most powerful crime bosses
fighting each other and when the dust settles,

00:03:19.279 --> 00:03:23.999
the Penguin will assert himself.

00:03:23.999 --> 00:03:27.419
Number 2 - Bruce Wayne, World’s Greatest
Detective In Training

00:03:27.419 --> 00:03:31.209
I wouldn’t be surprised if he does end up
connecting his parent’s murder to arkham

00:03:31.209 --> 00:03:33.560
and the war that’s going on.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.819
Gordon would be the one to handle the dirty
work.

00:03:35.819 --> 00:03:40.590
But solving the mystery would be a big way
to keep the Bruce character involved in the

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.090
story in an important way.

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:45.810
Otherwise there’s no reason for him to even
be on the show every week.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:50.371
It’s still early in the season, but David
Mazouz is a main character, so Bruce Wayne

00:03:50.371 --> 00:03:53.390
will have to become a critical part of the
solution.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:58.900
And because he’s a tiny-sized batman right
now, the best way for him to help is via detective

00:03:58.900 --> 00:03:59.900
work.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.099
Batman has riddle solving abilities that rival
edward nygma.

00:04:01.099 --> 00:04:08.480
Which actually reminds me, he’ll probably
figure everything out to and just land on

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.569
the wrong side of the war.

00:04:10.569 --> 00:04:23.440
Like he’ll wind up on the wrong side of
Gordon.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:30.680
Or Bullock will push him too far.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.830
Number 1 - The Rise of Arkham

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:46.440
So they’re going to rebuild Arkham Asylum
and turn everything else around it into a

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:49.140
dump pretty much.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.581
The original plan was to gentrify it and make
everything nice and shiny.

00:04:52.581 --> 00:04:53.581
Like the way people refer to Ronald Reagan’s
Shining City on the Hill Speech.

00:04:53.581 --> 00:04:57.340
Arkham was going to be this shining example
of hope at the heart of the city.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.639
But now obviously it’s headed in the opposite
direction.

00:04:59.639 --> 00:05:03.610
It’s turning into the Arkham we know and
love.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.669
The Harvard for psychopaths.

00:05:05.669 --> 00:05:10.250
The origin story they’re trying to tell
here will explain how all these batman supervillains

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:14.090
like the Joker, Hugo Strange and the Scarecrow
could come from Arkham.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:17.409
What happened there that it produces so many
crazy villains.

00:05:17.409 --> 00:05:20.460
We’re just starting to see that happen.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.039
Psycho Ward being built next to a giant trash
dump.

00:05:23.039 --> 00:05:31.690
I can’t wait to see what a gothic nightmare
they’ll turn it into.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:35.129
Let me know though, what was your favorite
moment, and do you think the Penguin really

00:05:35.129 --> 00:05:36.949
killed the waynes.

00:05:36.949 --> 00:05:42.860
I know it’s different from the comics, but
even if he didn’t do it himself, he could

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.940
have hired someone to do it for him.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:48.980
Overall I gave the episode a B. I’m loving
the Arkham storyline but I feel like the story

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:54.539
is still getting bogged down trying to service
the Gordon Barbara plot and the other minor

00:05:54.539 --> 00:05:55.539
villains.

00:05:55.539 --> 00:06:00.539
What I’d like to see is them just drill
down more on the core characters.

00:06:00.539 --> 00:06:02.900
The Penguin, Maroni and the Roman, Bullock
and Gordon.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.610
I don’t mind the amount of time they spend
with Bruce either.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.580
But I feel like they need to make him a more
substantial part of the action.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.710
Like he needs to be more precocious.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:15.789
Like spending more time snooping through the
police archives and causing trouble.

00:06:15.789 --> 00:06:20.190
I feel like Selena Kyle would be of great
assistance in such matters.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:27.340
Right now if feels like the show is trying
to be so serious with villains poking eyeballs

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:30.280
out, that it’s not letting the characters
have any fun.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.610
Let me know what you guys think.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:35.770
Do you like Gotham dark and gritty or do you
want to see some more humor.

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:39.760
It doesn’t have to be campy humor, but I
feel like it’s a little too serious right

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:40.840
now.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.949
Someone needs to blow off some steam.

00:06:42.949 --> 00:06:46.220
Next week is episode 5, Victor Zasz shows
up again.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:48.750
I’ll post my video after the episode airs.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.590
So be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:55.319
The big news right now is that Robert Downey
Jr was just written into Captain America 3

00:06:55.319 --> 00:06:59.099
and a producer on Batman vs Superman explained
Wonder Woman’s origin story.

00:06:59.099 --> 00:07:03.360
I’ll be doing a separate reaction video
next for this, but Robert Downey Jr is getting

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.870
paid 40 Million dollars to appear in Captain
America 3.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:10.150
Which all but confirms they’re doing the
Civil War storyline.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:14.810
Again, I’ll post a full video explaining
everything, because there was literally a

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:22.639
behind the scenes war with the marvel executives
over the movie.

00:07:22.639 --> 00:07:24.889
It’s crazy.

00:07:24.889 --> 00:07:29.889
The Wonder Woman news is just that her origin
story will be the New 52 version from the

00:07:29.889 --> 00:07:30.889
comics.

00:07:30.889 --> 00:07:35.590
That means that instead of being made of clay,
she’ll be the daughter of Hippolyta, queen

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.960
of the amazons and Zeus.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:41.000
In the comics, she takes the title of God
of War.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.449
So that’s what she’ll be in the movie.

00:07:43.449 --> 00:07:44.629
The demigod daughter of Zeus.

00:07:44.629 --> 00:07:45.800
Which will explain her powers.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.979
